{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fast-Paced &amp; Action-Packed Puzzle Platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congregate utilizes: puzzle, platforming, and action scenarios to constantly keep you engaged and on your toes! In this simple yet captivating experience, you play as a sentient cube with the sole objective of gathering as many coins as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Wide Variety Of Levels &amp; Puzzle Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From pressure pads with different functionality each to gravity manipulation, more puzzle pieces gradually get introduced the further you advance within the levels. This game has 50 levels to offer, each evenly bundled into separate sectors.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758880?t=1748722652","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758880?t=1748722652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758880/dae5a21ccaca0a9280a50ef186c0a085a263b424/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748722652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758880/dae5a21ccaca0a9280a50ef186c0a085a263b424/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748722652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3776530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fast-Paced &amp; Action-Packed Puzzle Platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congregate utilizes: puzzle, platforming, and action scenarios to constantly keep you engaged and on your toes! In this simple yet captivating experience, you play as a sentient cube with the sole objective of gathering as many coins as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Wide Variety Of Levels &amp; Puzzle Elements